  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="work" n="156">
        <pb n="203"/>
        <head>Another.</head>
        <head>156 — ii — V. — <quote>The Lord hath sent salvation to his people</quote><ptr type="noteAnchor" xml:id="a1" target="#n1" n="1"/>.</head>
        <div type="section">
          <ab n="1">For the wrath that is laid upon us by reason of our sins we have found a<ptr type="noteAnchor" xml:id="a2" target="#n2" n="2"/> healing drug [and a helpful<ptr type="noteAnchor" xml:id="a3" target="#n3" n="3"/> and ready medicine, Lord, in the [troop of illustrious valiant soldiers girt with the suprasensual arms of the Holy Spirit<ptr type="noteAnchor" xml:id="a4" target="#n4" n="4"/>, the forty martyrs, equal in number to the [perfect and holy<ptr type="noteAnchor" xml:id="a5" target="#n5" n="5"/> days of the fast: <pb n="204"/> who by the heat of the Spirit quenched the severe cold that came from the snow and the chill of the ice of the pool, and trampled upon the devil breathing from the north, and put on crowns of victory over him : by whose<ptr type="noteAnchor" xml:id="a6" target="#n6" n="6"/> prayers, Lord of all, grant in thy grace that we also may sharpen the arms of the fast through abstinence and with them contend against him, [in order<ptr type="noteAnchor" xml:id="a7" target="#n7" n="7"/> that we may withdraw ourselves and escape from all the activity of the fiends, by the might of thy life-giving Cross, thou who alone art mighty and merciful.</ab>
        </div>
      </div>
      <noteGrp>
        <note xml:id="n1" target="#a1" n="1"><choice><reg/><orig>p. 203, n. 4</orig></choice> Ps. cxi, 9.</note>
        <note xml:id="n2" target="#a2" n="2"><choice><reg/><orig>p. 203, n. 5</orig></choice> Corr. <quote>a cessation, a</quote>.</note>
        <note xml:id="n3" target="#a3" n="3"><choice><reg/><orig>p. 203, n. 6</orig></choice> Corr. <quote>for evils and a helper</quote>.</note>
        <note xml:id="n4" target="#a4" n="4"><choice><reg/><orig>p. 203, n. 7</orig></choice> Corr. <quote>company of spiritual armed men (representing <foreign xml:lang="grc">ὁπλῖται</foreign>)</quote>.</note>
        <note xml:id="n5" target="#a5" n="5"><choice><reg/><orig>p. 203, n. 8</orig></choice> Corr. <quote>very honourable and hallowed</quote>.</note>
        <note xml:id="n6" target="#a6" n="6"><choice><reg/><orig>p. 204, n. 1</orig></choice> Corr. <quote>their</quote>.</note>
        <note xml:id="n7" target="#a7" n="7"><choice><reg/><orig>p. 204, n. 2</orig></choice> Corr. <quote>to (the end)</quote>.</note>
      </noteGrp>
